00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:08.100
Right, that can become a delusion, right?

534
00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:09.810
Like someday we're gonna make movies

535
00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:11.370
but we gotta make the money first.

536
00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:13.680
Or I went to law school and it was like,

537
00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.660
well, I didn't go to law school so I could work

538
00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:18.600
in a big corporate law firm but I gotta pay these loans off

539
00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.280
and when I get enough money, then I'll end up

