00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:24.450
pursuing the thing that I actually wanna do.

541
00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:27.420
Most people never get to that because they're so unhappy,

542
00:22:27.420 --> 00:22:29.730
they start to overspend,

543
00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:32.310
to compensate for their lack of happiness

544
00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:35.113
until they're so leveraged that they're stuck in a situation

545
00:22:35.113 --> 00:22:36.933
they never wanted to be in in the first place.

546
00:22:36.933 --> 00:22:40.260
Yeah, it's so true and so like, to your point,

547
00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:41.863
I literally say, oh, well, we'll do this when.

548
00:22:41.863 --> 00:22:44.460
And oh, we'll do it when we have enough money,

549
00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:47.430
when we have enough time, when I have the confidence,

550
00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:49.290
there's always like, we'll do it when.

551
00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:50.850
And so the thing that I'd love to ask your audience

552
00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:53.070
right now is like, when are they looking at?

553
00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:55.350
Well, the goal post always move because as soon as you get

554
00:22:55.350 --> 00:22:58.140
close to that and it becomes a potential reality,

