00:26:26.693 --> 00:26:29.070
there's 1500 bars, we need another bar,

645
00:26:29.070 --> 00:26:30.660
like we need a hole in the head.

646
00:26:30.660 --> 00:26:33.660
So that was a feedback we got when we had the idea.

647
00:26:33.660 --> 00:26:35.710
So as the Greek wife, I was like,

648
00:26:35.710 --> 00:26:37.410
babe, how can I support you?

649
00:26:37.410 --> 00:26:39.717
You're on this new venture, I'm so happy for you,

