00:26:48.450 --> 00:26:49.980
and fight for my mom.

654
00:26:49.980 --> 00:26:54.240
Like I can fight for her to help on this health journey.

655
00:26:54.240 --> 00:26:56.833
And so, that's why it was very important for him

656
00:26:56.833 --> 00:26:59.550
to really kinda go all in.

