726
00:29:45.630 --> 00:29:49.770
Like if it's not movies because right now to make movies,

727
00:29:49.770 --> 00:29:52.620
especially how we were dreaming, the big budget,

728
00:29:52.620 --> 00:29:53.700
it was just, it wasn't feasible.

729
00:29:53.700 --> 00:29:55.800
We would have to keep chasing money.

730
00:29:55.800 --> 00:29:57.450
And we saw where that led.

731
00:29:57.450 --> 00:29:58.743
And so in that moment it was like,

732
00:29:58.743 --> 00:30:00.750
what is actually going to fill our heart?

733
00:30:00.750 --> 00:30:05.750
What is actually going to help us feel alive again?

734
00:30:06.150 --> 00:30:11.150
And it was in that discussion which then led Tom to protein

735
00:30:11.460 --> 00:30:12.660
so his business partners,

736
