737
00:30:14.850 --> 00:30:16.830
One of the guys was obsessed with nutrition

738
00:30:16.830 --> 00:30:19.260
and the other guy was just obsessed with working out.

739
00:30:19.260 --> 00:30:21.420
And so Tom was just like, his own reason,

740
00:30:21.420 --> 00:30:24.480
he could get behind it to fight for his mom.

741
00:30:24.480 --> 00:30:27.240
And when you have a mission like that that is so tied to you

742
00:30:27.240 --> 00:30:29.220
