743
00:30:29.220 --> 00:30:31.170
he was just like, babe, this makes me feel good

744
00:30:31.170 --> 00:30:32.430
about myself.

745
00:30:32.430 --> 00:30:34.527
This makes me be able to face the things that

746
00:30:34.527 --> 00:30:37.473
I'm not good at and be able to push myself to be better.

747
00:30:39.270 --> 00:30:41.850
Prophets walk among us.

748
00:30:41.850 --> 00:30:45.420
As a writer and podcaster for nearly 10 years,

749
00:30:45.420 --> 00:30:48.240
I've become more convinced than ever that our world

750
00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:52.350
