751
00:30:52.350 --> 00:30:54.720
who have amazing stories to share.

752
00:30:54.720 --> 00:30:57.930
Those that we don't know who can teach us something new

753
00:30:57.930 --> 00:31:00.360
and leave us all the better for the experience

754
00:31:00.360 --> 00:31:01.890
of their sharing.

755
00:31:01.890 --> 00:31:04.260
And so I've dedicated my career to tracking down

756
00:31:04.260 --> 00:31:06.690
