01:32:03.990 --> 01:32:06.750
in ways that don't actually align with who you wanna be.

2241
01:32:06.750 --> 01:32:09.603
And so for me, it was like a fine line between,

2242
01:32:10.530 --> 01:32:12.810
okay, I really do want to please my husband,

2243
01:32:12.810 --> 01:32:15.720
I want him to be happy but where does it go to them

2244
01:32:15.720 --> 01:32:18.690
now become detrimental to who I want to be?

2245
01:32:18.690 --> 01:32:21.000
And the transition where I went from being

2246
01:32:21.000 --> 01:32:24.300
the supportive wife that was taken care of every need

2247
01:32:24.300 --> 01:32:27.180
that he had into being an entrepreneur

2248
01:32:27.180 --> 01:32:29.670
and an equal business partner, we had to talk about that

2249
01:32:29.670 --> 01:32:33.150
because I was so trying to do both, right?

2250
01:32:33.150 --> 01:32:35.460
You want to be there for the person

2251
01:32:35.460 --> 01:32:37.470
and you want to please them and you wanna make them happy

2252
01:32:37.470 --> 01:32:39.300
and you wanna show up in your business.

2253
01:32:39.300 --> 01:32:41.880
And I don't know about how you felt but it was like,

2254
01:32:41.880 --> 01:32:45.030
I couldn't do both well at all or either well at all.

2255
01:32:45.030 --> 01:32:48.240
Well, first of all, you have to have some recognition

2256
01:32:48.240 --> 01:32:51.150
that you're not living in alignment with the person

2257
01:32:51.150 --> 01:32:52.173
you wanna be.

2258
01:32:53.970 --> 01:32:57.150
So there's that piece and then there's the piece

2259
01:32:57.150 --> 01:32:59.400
of figuring out how to communicate.

2260
01:32:59.400 --> 01:33:01.740
Well, I think what, let me back up.

2261
01:33:01.740 --> 01:33:04.350
I think when you're in that state,

2262
01:33:04.350 --> 01:33:06.360
there's not a lot of self-reflection, right?

2263
01:33:06.360 --> 01:33:08.250
Because you're like, you're pleasing other people

2264
01:33:08.250 --> 01:33:11.220
and this is your MO, right?

2265
01:33:11.220 --> 01:33:15.750
So you're not looking inward so you're not really gauging

2266
01:33:15.750 --> 01:33:18.177
that disconnect between the person you wanna be

2267
01:33:18.177 --> 01:33:21.930
and the role that you're fulfilling until sort of the heat

2268
01:33:21.930 --> 01:33:24.060
gets turned up and then you become unhappy

2269
01:33:24.060 --> 01:33:26.070
and then you're confused, why am I unhappy?

2270
01:33:26.070 --> 01:33:27.660
I'm doing all these other things.

2271
01:33:27.660 --> 01:33:31.500
So there has to be some kinda like inflection point.

2272
01:33:31.500 --> 01:33:34.830
And then there's the piece around, how do you communicate

2273
01:33:34.830 --> 01:33:38.130
around that to kinda step out of the role

2274
01:33:38.130 --> 01:33:41.040
that you're playing and find a better, healthier one.

2275
01:33:41.040 --> 01:33:43.500
That is so true, 100% 'cause you're right,

2276
01:33:43.500 --> 01:33:46.050
I didn't even realize that that's what I was doing.

2277
01:33:46.050 --> 01:33:48.900
So sitting there having the reflection of does this,

2278
01:33:48.900 --> 01:33:50.460
who do I wanna be?

2279
01:33:50.460 --> 01:33:52.860
Who do I wanna show up as every day that makes me feel good,

2280
01:33:52.860 --> 01:33:55.050
that gives me the life that I want?

2281
01:33:55.050 --> 01:33:57.777
And then maybe it's even just taking account like

2282
01:33:57.777 --> 01:34:00.120
you just sit back with no judgment and take account

2283
01:34:00.120 --> 01:34:02.460
of your week and it's like, oh, I woke up

2284
01:34:02.460 --> 01:34:05.100
and I made my husband coffee.

2285
01:34:05.100 --> 01:34:07.740
And then I did the laundry for him and then Ryan it's like,

2286
01:34:07.740 --> 01:34:09.510
how many of those were for you?

2287
01:34:09.510 --> 01:34:11.210
And maybe that becomes the first part of it

2288
01:34:11.210 --> 01:34:14.220
in just self-assessing where your time and energy is going

2289
01:34:14.220 --> 01:34:16.020
because you may not realize that you're doing it

2290
01:34:16.020 --> 01:34:17.550
because you're an autopilot.

2291
01:34:17.550 --> 01:34:20.200
So actually I think that's a beautiful place to start

2292
01:34:21.300 --> 01:34:23.543
and then recognizing how it can hold you back

2293
01:34:23.543 --> 01:34:26.160
on what you're trying to do and then I use the words,

2294
01:34:26.160 --> 01:34:27.300
does it serve you, right?

2295
01:34:27.300 --> 01:34:29.940
So if you've got your goal, if you've got that idea

2296
01:34:29.940 --> 01:34:32.790
of who you want to be and then you take the inventory

2297
01:34:32.790 --> 01:34:35.790
of your day and then say, does this act serve this person

2298
01:34:35.790 --> 01:34:36.870
that you wanna be?

2299
01:34:36.870 --> 01:34:39.960
And then if the answer is no, how do you communicate that

2300
01:34:39.960 --> 01:34:40.980
