2301
01:34:40.980 --> 01:34:44.310
That was really hard for me because with my husband,

2302
01:34:44.310 --> 01:34:46.860
I had told him I wanted four children.

2303
01:34:46.860 --> 01:34:49.680
And so here I was, I was a stay-at-home wife taking care

2304
01:34:49.680 --> 01:34:52.950
of him every single need he had to the point where

2305
01:34:52.950 --> 01:34:55.200
he would get home from work, his dinner was waiting for him.

2306
01:34:55.200 --> 01:34:56.730
He'd wake up in the morning, his gym clothes

2307
01:34:56.730 --> 01:34:58.890
