2308
01:34:58.890 --> 01:35:01.380
He'd put his gym clothes on, I would hand him his key.

2309
01:35:01.380 --> 01:35:05.061
I mean, I'm talking every ounce of thing that he needed

2310
01:35:05.061 --> 01:35:07.530
and this was a decision we made together.

2311
