2313
01:35:13.020 --> 01:35:15.090
And I know, the funny thing is now I laugh at it

2314
01:35:15.090 --> 01:35:17.400
but I was the one that actually said that

2315
01:35:17.400 --> 01:35:20.697
because at the time the decision was he was gonna go

2316
01:35:20.697 --> 01:35:23.850
and make money for movies and we had just read an interview

2317
01:35:23.850 --> 01:35:27.600
