of his time making decisions of things that don't matter.

2319
01:35:29.490 --> 01:35:31.525
Like same black t-shirt every day, that whole thing.

2320
01:35:31.525 --> 01:35:32.490
Exactly.

2321
01:35:32.490 --> 01:35:33.515
So that's what we did.

2322
01:35:33.515 --> 01:35:34.410
I was like, oh, that makes sense.

2323
01:35:34.410 --> 01:35:37.680
Babe, I'll make every decision for you outside of business.

2324
01:35:37.680 --> 01:35:41.460
That way we can expedite the business side of it

2325
01:35:41.460 --> 01:35:43.620
and we can hopefully make more money in a shorter period

2326
01:35:43.620 --> 01:35:45.150
of time and now we can go make movies.

2327
01:35:45.150 --> 01:35:48.438
So that's why I decided you wake up, your clothes are there.

2328
01:35:48.438 --> 01:35:51.060
You go to work, I hand you a lunch bag.

2329
01:35:51.060 --> 01:35:52.710
Like I did everything.

2330
01:35:52.710 --> 01:35:54.300
And so then flash forward-

2331
01:35:54.300 --> 01:35:56.760
You slowly disappear in the process of doing that.

2332
01:35:56.760 --> 01:36:00.690
So then exactly, you then you do 100%

2333
