2334
01:36:03.540 --> 01:36:06.180
I loved business and I was trying to juggle both.

2335
01:36:06.180 --> 01:36:09.330
Now in that I was just not doing anything well.

2336
01:36:09.330 --> 01:36:11.610
And so that became the point of, well, who do I wanna be?

2337
01:36:11.610 --> 01:36:13.410
What do I actually wanna do?

2338
01:36:13.410 --> 01:36:14.970
And I realized I loved entrepreneurship.

2339
01:36:14.970 --> 01:36:16.650
I love being challenged.

2340
01:36:16.650 --> 01:36:18.960
I love showing myself what I'm capable of.

2341
01:36:18.960 --> 01:36:21.240
One day, not knowing something, not having a skill set

2342
01:36:21.240 --> 01:36:24.150
and then facing that and then trying and finally succeeding

2343
01:36:24.150 --> 01:36:25.830
just lit me up.

2344
01:36:25.830 --> 01:36:27.910
And so I had to sit down and communicate that with Tom

2345
01:36:27.910 --> 01:36:32.190
and a big part of that was A, showing your partner respect

2346
01:36:32.190 --> 01:36:35.010
that I was the one changing.

2347
01:36:35.010 --> 01:36:36.030
And I had to be honest with that.

2348
01:36:36.030 --> 01:36:38.610
It's like, yes, I was this person

2349
01:36:38.610 --> 01:36:40.560
and now I am the one changing.

2350
01:36:40.560 --> 01:36:42.633
So having the respect to show them.

2351
01:36:44.010 --> 01:36:47.850
Then number two, I was like, I know my husband wants me,

2352
01:36:47.850 --> 01:36:49.620
he wants like me to be happy.

2353
01:36:49.620 --> 01:36:52.307
So I need to express how unhappy I was

2354
01:36:52.307 --> 01:36:53.793
'cause I never told him.

2355
01:36:54.840 --> 01:36:57.930
And so I need to express how unhappy I was for eight years

2356
01:36:57.930 --> 01:37:01.050
and then express him how this is making me happy.

2357
01:37:01.050 --> 01:37:03.630
And then I need to give him the grace to be honest

2358
01:37:03.630 --> 01:37:05.640
about how he feels.

2359
01:37:05.640 --> 01:37:08.670
And so in that I said, babe, I was profoundly unhappy,

2360
01:37:08.670 --> 01:37:11.820
I've now found myself but I love you more than sorry,

2361
01:37:11.820 --> 01:37:13.530
I love you more than life itself

2362
01:37:13.530 --> 01:37:15.420
but I no longer wanna put your clothes out.

2363
01:37:15.420 --> 01:37:16.620
I no longer wanna clean with you,

2364
01:37:16.620 --> 01:37:18.326
in fact, I freaking hate it.

2365
01:37:18.326 --> 01:37:19.950
Still means I love you.

2366
01:37:19.950 --> 01:37:23.940
Doesn't change how I feel about you but I absolutely hate

2367
01:37:23.940 --> 01:37:26.250
what I'm doing at home.

2368
01:37:26.250 --> 01:37:28.140
And so, I don't wanna do your laundry anymore.

2369
01:37:28.140 --> 01:37:30.300
And so his response was-

2370
01:37:30.300 --> 01:37:31.740
It's not an unreasonable request.

2371
01:37:31.740 --> 01:37:33.810
You're right but he was just like,

2372
01:37:33.810 --> 01:37:36.750
look, what kinda husband would I be that I would put laundry

2373
01:37:36.750 --> 01:37:38.220
ahead of your happiness?

2374
01:37:38.220 --> 01:37:40.500
So he was like so look, if you don't do the laundry

2375
01:37:40.500 --> 01:37:42.810
and I have to go work to work commando,

2376
01:37:42.810 --> 01:37:44.490
then I'll go to work commando.

2377
01:37:44.490 --> 01:37:46.830
And then we joke but then literally like five weeks later

2378
01:37:46.830 --> 01:37:49.350
or something, I didn't do the laundry for about five weeks.

2379
01:37:49.350 --> 01:37:50.910
And he's like, babe, I'm out of underwear.

2380
01:37:50.910 --> 01:37:52.890
So I'm going to work commando with no underwear on.

2381
01:37:52.890 --> 01:37:56.070
And I was like, all right, bye, thanks.

2382
01:37:56.070 --> 01:37:57.810
But that's an actual true story

2383
01:37:57.810 --> 01:38:00.750
and that was because we communicated,

2384
01:38:00.750 --> 01:38:04.500
I was very open about how I felt and where I was in my life.

2385
01:38:04.500 --> 01:38:07.710
I gave him this space to also tell me how he felt

2386
01:38:07.710 --> 01:38:08.543
and he was honest.

2387
01:38:08.543 --> 01:38:10.590
And he's like, look, of course,

2388
01:38:10.590 --> 01:38:12.101
I love you taking care of me.

2389
01:38:12.101 --> 01:38:13.800
Like what crazy person wouldn't love the fact

2390
01:38:13.800 --> 01:38:15.180
