2403
01:38:41.130 --> 01:38:43.860
That way, it's a slow transition and you don't feel like

2404
01:38:43.860 --> 01:38:45.180
I've just abandoned.

2405
01:38:45.180 --> 01:38:46.800
He's like, actually, that sounds really nice.

2406
01:38:46.800 --> 01:38:47.760
Thank you for that.

2407
01:38:47.760 --> 01:38:49.820
So I showed him, I was being considerate.

2408
01:38:49.820 --> 01:38:53.520
He was now being on board with the transition

2409
01:38:53.520 --> 01:38:55.500
and it ended up like he just supported me

2410
01:38:55.500 --> 01:38:58.170
and it became like this beautiful moment where we were able

2411
01:38:58.170 --> 01:39:00.030
to really show up for each other.

2412
01:39:00.030 --> 01:39:01.890
And then the last piece of everything

2413
01:39:01.890 --> 01:39:05.130
that I've just laid out is the grieving part.

2414
01:39:05.130 --> 01:39:09.120
He had to grieve the wife that I was and I had to grieve

2415
01:39:09.120 --> 01:39:12.420
the wife and mother I thought I was going to be.

2416
01:39:12.420 --> 01:39:14.850
So what I mean by that is I decided that I no longer

2417
