Now, my husband really wasn't, he was just like,

2419
01:39:17.267 --> 01:39:18.960
if you really want children, like he,

2420
01:39:18.960 --> 01:39:20.790
it wasn't as big a deal to him.

2421
01:39:20.790 --> 01:39:22.860
But I realized I loved business so much,

2422
01:39:22.860 --> 01:39:25.500
so much that I had to process whether I wanted children.

2423
01:39:25.500 --> 01:39:27.460
I talk about that in the book, how I processed it

2424
01:39:27.460 --> 01:39:29.490
and I came to the conclusion that I didn't,

2425
01:39:29.490 --> 01:39:32.580
actually loved my life and I didn't want children.

2426
01:39:32.580 --> 01:39:35.940
And so even talking to him about that,

2427
01:39:35.940 --> 01:39:38.160
I decided I didn't want children but that didn't mean

2428
01:39:38.160 --> 01:39:38.993
there was a part of me

2429
01:39:38.993 --> 01:39:41.280
that didn't desperately want children.

2430
01:39:41.280 --> 01:39:44.160
And so I just had to be honest with myself that

2431
01:39:44.160 --> 01:39:46.710
just because we make one decision in life,

2432
01:39:46.710 --> 01:39:49.170
