2434
01:39:52.470 --> 01:39:54.720
And I think it's important to address it

2435
01:39:54.720 --> 01:39:57.450
and then maybe mourn and grieve it and that's what I did.

2436
01:39:57.450 --> 01:40:00.810
I still today, which I still today would love to see

2437
01:40:00.810 --> 01:40:03.750
little Tom running around, have a daughter that could like

2438
01:40:03.750 --> 01:40:07.322
I could help build like a strong mindset that I never had,

2439
01:40:07.322 --> 01:40:09.810
I could get excited over it.

2440
01:40:09.810 --> 01:40:12.630
So I knew that just because I didn't want children

2441
01:40:12.630 --> 01:40:14.760
or like I actually wanted children,

2442
01:40:14.760 --> 01:40:16.230
the only thing I wanted more than children

2443
01:40:16.230 --> 01:40:18.000
was to not have children.

2444
01:40:18.000 --> 01:40:21.900
So I had to give myself the grace to grieve

2445
01:40:21.900 --> 01:40:23.280
the idea of being a mother.

2446
01:40:23.280 --> 01:40:25.470
I had to give Tom the grace to grieve the idea

2447
01:40:25.470 --> 01:40:27.420
that we weren't gonna have children.

2448
01:40:27.420 --> 01:40:30.150
And then we were able to overcome it that I can actually

2449
01:40:30.150 --> 01:40:33.540
say it with total honesty and clarity that,

2450
01:40:33.540 --> 01:40:36.210
yes, it's still heartbreaking but it literally holds no tie

2451
01:40:36.210 --> 01:40:37.830
to my heart anymore.

2452
01:40:37.830 --> 01:40:40.500
Well, it's also a situation where everybody's gonna have

2453
01:40:40.500 --> 01:40:42.240
a lot of opinions and judgments.

2454
01:40:42.240 --> 01:40:43.361
Yes, oh my God, just so-

2455
01:40:43.361 --> 01:40:45.900
And you have to be prepared to be on the receiving end

2456
01:40:45.900 --> 01:40:49.530
of everybody questioning that or having their idea

2457
01:40:49.530 --> 01:40:50.363
around that.

2458
01:40:50.363 --> 01:40:52.890
Yes and actually going back to the people pleasing

2459
01:40:52.890 --> 01:40:56.310
subjects, my mom told me growing up my entire life,

2460
01:40:56.310 --> 01:40:57.510
even when I got married,

2461
01:40:58.500 --> 01:41:01.950
I want nothing more in life than to be a grandmother.

2462
01:41:01.950 --> 01:41:03.660
Those words actually came out,

2463
01:41:03.660 --> 01:41:06.003
Now I had then decided I wasn't gonna have kids.

2464
01:41:06.003 --> 01:41:10.170
So I had to tell her and I knew she would devastated,

2465
01:41:10.170 --> 01:41:13.620
I knew I'd break her heart and so how do you make sure

2466
01:41:13.620 --> 01:41:16.560
that you still hold true to who you are and what you want

2467
01:41:16.560 --> 01:41:19.530
in life knowing that you are about to hurt someone?

2468
01:41:19.530 --> 01:41:21.450
To your point, you have to stand firm

2469
01:41:21.450 --> 01:41:24.510
and really ground yourself in your decision

2470
01:41:24.510 --> 01:41:27.390
before you tell anyone else, because to your point,

2471
01:41:27.390 --> 01:41:28.613
people are gonna come to you.

2472
01:41:28.613 --> 01:41:29.795
They're gonna try and persuade you.

2473
01:41:29.795 --> 01:41:30.870
They're gonna try and degrade you.

2474
01:41:30.870 --> 01:41:33.483
They're gonna try and tell you why you are wrong.

2475
01:41:34.530 --> 01:41:37.590
And so, how do you stay firm without being like a bully

2476
01:41:37.590 --> 01:41:39.630
in the China shop that's like, don't you talk to me

2477
01:41:39.630 --> 01:41:41.581
like that, I've decided not to have kids 'cause again,

2478
01:41:41.581 --> 01:41:44.250
that doesn't help my relationship with my mom either.

2479
01:41:44.250 --> 01:41:45.810
So how do you do it with grace?

2480
01:41:45.810 --> 01:41:49.470
How do you show up and communicate that without giving up

2481
01:41:49.470 --> 01:41:52.680
or backtracking on this decision that is really aligned

2482
01:41:52.680 --> 01:41:53.797
with who you wanna be?

2483
01:41:53.797 --> 01:41:55.355
Right, so how do you do it?

2484
01:41:55.355 --> 01:41:56.313
